@SkeLLLa We could allow to a plugin to override this part

https://github.com/fastify/fastify/blob/92f474ea8c981bca64f46427383ed56d50d40998/fastify.js#L226-L227

So a plugin is able to customize its log child creation totally.

> @allevo In this case I don't see reasons why logger is part of the core. Making it as plugin will allow to configure it accordingly without overrides.

@SkeLLLa logging is very important and will slow down your application if not done correctly. Since in our team we have two core developers of [pino](https://github.com/pinojs/pino) it makes sense that we give it out of the box to enable the best performances.

In any case, you can [customize](https://www.fastify.io/docs/latest/Logging/) almost everything.
